{
  "title": "Baba Biswakarma Puja Mantra",
  "titleBengali": "বাবা বিশ্বকর্মা পূজা মন্ত্র",
  "content": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"BN\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(251, 140, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 26px;\">বাবা বিশ্বকর্মা\nপূজার মন্ত্র</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;Siyam Rupali&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px; font-weight: bold;\">অপবিত্র পাঠ মন্ত্র:</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ওঁম</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">&nbsp;অপবিত্রঃ পবিত্রো বা,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">সর্বাবস্থাং গতোহপি বা।</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">যঃ স্মরেৎ পুণ্ডরীকাক্ষং,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">স বাহ্যভ্যন্তরঃ শুচিঃ।।</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px; font-weight: bold;\">বিষ্ণু স্মরণ মন্ত্র:</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ওঁম</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">&nbsp;সর্বমঙ্গল মঙ্গল্যং,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">বরেণ্যং বরদং শুভম্।</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">নারায়ণং নমস্কৃত্য,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">সর্বকর্মানি কারয়েৎ।</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">নমো বিষ্ণুঃ, নমো বিষ্ণুঃ, নমো বিষ্ণুঃ।।</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">তদ্ বিষ্ণু পরমং পদম্,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">সদা পশ্যন্তি সূরয়ঃ,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">দিপীব চক্ষুরাততম্।&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">নমঃ মাধব, মাধব বাচি,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">মাধব মাধব হৃদি।&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">মাধব স্মরন্তি সাধব,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">সর্ব কার্যেষু,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">শ্রী মাধব, শ্রী মাধব,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">শ্রী মাধবায় নমঃ।।</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px; font-weight: bold;\">সামবেদীয় সঙ্কল্পসূক্ত:</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ওঁম</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">&nbsp;দেবো বো দ্রবিণোদাঃ,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">পূর্ণাং বিবষ্ট্যা সিচম্,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">উদ্ধা সিঞ্চধ্বমুপবা,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">পূণধ্বমাদিদ্বো দেব ও হতে ।।</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">যজুর্ব্বেদীয় সঙ্কল্পসূত্র:</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ওঁম</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">&nbsp;যজ্জাগ্রতো দূরমুদৈতি দৈবং,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">তদুসুপ্তস্য তথৈবেতি,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">দূরং গমং জ্যোতিষাং জ্যোতিরেকম্,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">তন্মে মনঃ শিব সঙ্কল্পমস্তু ।।</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px; font-weight: bold;\">ঋবেদীয় সঙ্কল্পসূত্র:</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ওঁম</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">&nbsp;যা গুং গূরা সিনীবালী যা,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">রাকা যা সরস্বতী,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ইন্দ্রাণীমহব উতয়ে,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">বরুণানীং স্বস্তয়ে ।।</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px; font-weight: bold;\">বীজ মন্ত্র:</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ওঁম বিশ্বকর্মণে নমঃ ।।</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px; font-weight: bold;\">ধ্যান মন্ত্র:</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ওঁম</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">&nbsp;দংশপাল মহাবীর,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">সুচিত্রকর্ম্ম কারকঃ,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">বিশ্বকৃৎ বিশ্ববৃক্,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ধ্যান- ত্বং চ,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">বাসনা মান দণ্ডধৃক্ ।।</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px; font-weight: bold;\">প্রণাম মন্ত্র:</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">দেবশিল্পী মহাভাগ,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">দেবানাং কার্যসাধকঃ,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">বিশ্বকৰ্ম্মণ নমস্তুভ্যং,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">সৰ্ব্বাভীষ্টং প্রদায়ক ।।</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px; font-weight: bold;\">পুষ্পাঞ্জলি মন্ত্র:</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">দেবশিল্পী মহাভাগ,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">দেবানাং কার্যসাধকঃ,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">পূজাং গৃহাণ বিধিবৎ কল্যাণং,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">কুরু মে সদা ৷</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">আয়ুৰ্যশঃ বলং দেহি, শিল্পে দেহি,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">শুভাং মতি,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ধনং দেহি, যশো দেহি,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">বিশ্বকৰ্ম্মণ প্রসীদ মে ৷</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">শিল্পাচার্য্যং নমস্তুভ্যং,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">নানালঙ্কার ভূষিতম্,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">মম বিঘ্নবিনাশায় কল্যাণং,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">কুরু মে সদা ৷</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px; font-weight: bold;\">হোমের মন্ত্র:</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ওঁম</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">&nbsp;শিল্পাচার্য্য বিশ্বকর্মণে স্বাহা,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ইদম্ বিশ্বকর্মণে।</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px; font-weight: bold;\">বিসর্জন মন্ত্র:</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ওঁম</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">&nbsp;শ্রীবিশ্বকৰ্ম্মণং ক্ষমস্ব,&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">সংবৎসর ব্যতীতে,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">তু পুনরাগমনায় চ ।।</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px; font-weight: bold;\">শান্তিমন্ত্ৰ:</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ওঁম</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">&nbsp;ঋচং বাচং প্রপদ্যে,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">মনো যজুঃ প্রপদ্যে,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">সামপ্রাণং প্রপদ্যে,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">চক্ষুঃ শ্রোত্রং প্রপদ্যে,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">রাগো যঃ সহজো ময়ি,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">প্রাণাপানৌ যন্মে ছিদ্রং চক্ষুষো,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">হৃদয়স্য ব্যতিতীর্ণং বৃহস্পতিৰ্ম্মে,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">দধাতু শন্নো ভবতু ভুবনস্য যস্পতিঃ ।।</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ওঁম&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">স্বস্তি ন ইন্দ্রো বৃদ্ধশ্রবাঃ,</span></span></span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">স্বস্তি নঃ পূষা বিশ্ববেদাঃ,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">স্বস্তিনস্তার্নোঽরিষ্টনেমিঃ,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">স্বস্তি নো বৃহস্পতিৰ্দ্দদাতু,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ওঁম</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">&nbsp;স্বস্তি,&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ওঁম</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">&nbsp;স্বস্তি,&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ওঁম</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">&nbsp;স্বস্তি ।।</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">অন্তরীক্ষঃ শান্তিঃ,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">বনস্পতয়ঃ শান্তিঃ,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ঔষধয় শান্তিঃ,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">সর্ববা রোগাদি পচ্ছান্তি শান্তি,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">গ্রাহপীড়দি শান্তি,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">শান্তিরেব শান্তিঃ,</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ওঁম</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">&nbsp;শান্তিঃ&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ওঁম</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">&nbsp;শান্তিঃ&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">ওঁম</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">&nbsp;শান্তিঃ ।।</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\">****</span></span></span></p>"
